<BaseLayout title="David Dindi Manufacturing | Custom Leather Goods" description="Explore custom manufacturing and production enquiries with David Dindi Manufacturing in South Africa.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">David Dindi Manufacturing</span><h1>From a clear idea to a considered product.</h1><p class="lead">A dedicated pathway for brands and businesses exploring custom manufacturing, product development and production partnerships.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/?type=manufacturing">Request a project discussion</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/our-story/">Meet the parent brand</a></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="hero-art-copy"><strong>Built around the brief.</strong><p>Start with the product, the intended customer and the requirements that matter most.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Potential service areas</span><h2>How we may be able to help.</h2></div><p>Final capabilities, minimum order quantities, lead times and materials are confirmed during project assessment.</p></div><div class="grid-3">
    <article class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>Custom manufacturing</h3><p>Discuss a product brief, material requirements, construction and intended use.</p></div></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>Sampling & prototyping</h3><p>Explore feasibility, samples and design refinement before larger production commitments.</p></div></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>Private-label projects</h3><p>Discuss brand-specific production needs, quality expectations and project scope.</p></div></article>
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="section section-muted"><div class="container grid-2"><div><span class="eyebrow">Help us understand your brief</span><h2>Useful information to include.</h2><ul class="list-clean"><li>Product type and intended use</li><li>Reference images, sketches or existing samples</li><li>Materials and finishes you have in mind</li><li>Estimated quantity and target timeline</li><li>Branding, packaging and quality requirements</li></ul></div><div class="split-panel"><h2>Start a conversation.</h2><p>Send the project overview first. We'll confirm whether the requirements fit our capabilities before discussing pricing or lead times.</p><a class="button button-sage" href="/contact/?type=manufacturing">Contact manufacturing</a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>